   <title><![CDATA[Josiah Stowe: Trump Tariffs, Inflation, and How To Prepare [Dead Men Walking Podcast]]]></title>
   <link/>
   <description><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.buzzsprout.com/twilio/text_messages/958282/open_sms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Send us a text</a></p>
<p>This week Greg sat down with Josiah Stowe. Josiah is the owner of&nbsp;<a href="https://www.dominionwealthstrategists.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dominion Wealth Strategists</a>. They discussed the affect the "Trump Tariffs" as well as inflation in general will have on the average american, as well as small business. They discussed a pragmatic approach to investing and real estate in the current economy, the sinfulness of an income tax, and questioned what economic laws they would institute under their version of theonomy. Enjoy!&nbsp;</p>
